{
  "name": "ICP 智能体新增多轮对话评测集",
  "version": "2026-09-03",
  "description": "在原有 19 组多轮用例之外新增的独立评测集。用例改用不同的表达方式，覆盖保持供电、支路保护、逻辑配置、显示合成、帧缓存、显示切换、BIT、自冷却、HMC 通配语义以及健康监测链路。",
  "defaults": {
    "assertions": {
      "min_used_evidence": 1,
      "min_citations": 1,
      "required_event_types": ["plan", "tool_call", "answer", "done"],
      "answer_not_contains": ["<内部推理>", "```json", "validated_relation"]
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "MT-HUM-01-holdover-boundary",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "输入瞬断与保持供电边界",
        "coverage": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query", "mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
        "expected_records": ["FUNC-140", "MFL-SYN-013", "HIS-SYN-005"]
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "symptom",
          "question": "外部供电只短暂塌了一下，整机却重新启动；如何判断是保持供电没有接住，而不是普通处理模块先失效？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["function_locator", "fmeca"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["FUNC-140", "FM-SYN-013"],
            "answer_regex": ["HUM|保持供电", "瞬断|保持", "能量|复位"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "verification",
          "question": "如果要复现并确认保持能力，试验时应观察什么时间窗口和电压门限？资料中的维修动作以及历史案例的验证结果是什么？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["mfl", "fault_history"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["MFL-SYN-013", "HIS-SYN-005"],
            "required_answer_facets": ["resolution", "history_time", "history_action", "history_result"],
            "answer_regex": ["80|120", "保持|瞬断", "验证|复现"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MT-PDU-01-false-trip",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "支路保护误动作",
        "coverage": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query", "mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
        "expected_records": ["FUNC-130", "MFL-SYN-011", "HIS-SYN-004"]
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "discriminate",
          "question": "钳形表测到 DPM 支路电流只有约 3.4 A，PDU 却反复把这一路切掉；怎样判断是采样偏置或保护参数问题，而不是真实过流？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["function_locator", "fmeca"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["FUNC-130", "FM-SYN-011"],
            "answer_regex": ["PDU|支路", "过流|保护", "采样|参数"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "repair",
          "question": "更换部件或重新加载保护参数后，应该怎样复测阈值、确认支路恢复，并说明历史上采取过的处理和最终验证？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["mfl", "fault_history"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["MFL-SYN-011", "HIS-SYN-004"],
            "required_answer_facets": ["resolution", "history_action", "history_result"],
            "answer_regex": ["阈值|电流", "支路|恢复", "复测|验证"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MT-FPA-01-logic-config",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "可编程逻辑配置失败",
        "coverage": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query", "mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
        "expected_records": ["FUNC-240", "MFL-SYN-028", "HIS-SYN-010"]
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "locate",
          "question": "系统上电进入逻辑加载阶段后，DONE 信号一直无效，高速预处理任务也没有起来；优先定位哪个模块和哪类接口？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["function_locator", "fmeca"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["FUNC-240", "FM-SYN-028"],
            "answer_regex": ["FPA|可编程逻辑", "DONE|配置", "接口|加载"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "version_check",
          "question": "如果板级检查发现配置接口位定义不对，维修步骤是什么？修复后还要怎样核对受控配置版本和启动结果？",
          "assertions": {
            "required_tools": ["mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
            "required_used_doc_types": ["mfl", "fault_history"],
            "any_used_record_ids": ["MFL-SYN-028", "HIS-SYN-010"],
            "required_answer_facets": ["resolution", "history_action", "history_result"],
            "answer_regex": ["重新加载|配置", "版本|受控", "验证|启动"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MT-DPM-01-render-task",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "显示合成任务异常",
        "coverage": ["function_locator", "fmeca_query", "mfl_query", "fault_history_query"],
        "expected_records": ["FUNC-410", "MFL-SYN-043", "HIS-SYN-015"]
